        "id": 22697,
        "name": "TheJayMann",
        "username": "TheJayMann",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-09-17T16:48:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Playing well with Absolute Zero requires a certain mentality, a bit of luck (make sure you can get your good cards out quickly, especially if there is a chance of loosing played cards), and making sure he has allies that play well with him.  He’s most effective with both Isothermic Transducer and Coolant Blast both in play, which then make cards like Hoarfire extremely powerful.  I can probably show you how I play him tomorrow.</p>",
